# Sandcastle
.sandcastle/.env
.sandcastle/worktrees/

# Claude Code (local worktrees + personal settings) — but track shared commands
# and skills. Skills are tracked because .sandcastle/new_flow/implement-prompt.md
# requires them: agents load them from the checked-out repo, which is the only
# source that reaches a CI runner and a cloud sandbox as well as your laptop.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
.vercel
.env*
